1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
Kofflard starts with one question: who do you like?

2
00:00:04,739 --> 00:00:06,791
Say, De Dijk.

3
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:13,566
Eleven musicians, side by side: safe, curious and wild, and a map of how they connect.

4
00:00:13,570 --> 00:00:16,806
Safe: Doe Maar, from the same Dutch stages.

5
00:00:16,816 --> 00:00:21,052
Curious: Boudewijn de Groot, older and quieter.

6
00:00:21,062 --> 00:00:24,394
And wild: Solomon Burke, American soul.

7
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:28,892
Every wild one says why: he made a whole album with De Dijk.

8
00:00:32,816 --> 00:00:35,916
Follow one, and the page starts again from there.

9
00:00:35,924 --> 00:00:38,200
Now everything starts from Doe Maar.

10
00:00:38,206 --> 00:00:42,538
And the wild ones lead to their roots: the ska of The Specials.

11
00:00:42,546 --> 00:00:45,558
One tap takes you back to De Dijk.

12
00:00:46,833 --> 00:00:49,397
Something else entirely: Eminem.

13
00:00:49,618 --> 00:00:52,638
Dido? He built Stan on her song.

14
00:00:54,813 --> 00:00:59,241
Too wild today? Click the Wild header, and the wild ones step aside.

15
00:00:59,256 --> 00:01:01,724
And back on, when you are curious again.

16
00:01:01,735 --> 00:01:06,005
One tap opens YouTube, or Spotify, or YouTube Music.

17
00:01:09,964 --> 00:01:12,242
Like one? Star it.

18
00:01:20,583 --> 00:01:22,443
Wherever your search takes you.

19
00:01:31,678 --> 00:01:33,900
And find them all again in your favourites.

20
00:01:35,532 --> 00:01:39,512
Kofflard. Find the music you did not know you were looking for.

